  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Measure to the Resilience of the Populations of Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to contribute to strengthening the resilience of the Burundian population. The specific objective is to contribute to increasing universal access to quality health services (in particular minimum package and complementary package), including sexual and reproductive health and to meet the specific health needs of populations in situation crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
